[[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752674\">2127A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752673\">2127A16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a) and (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Gear controls</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H37</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Robotized gearbox AUTO function switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H34</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the nuts fixing the complete lever.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064671.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the remaining fixing nut (1a) and remove the complete lever\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064672.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<p>1. If necessary, dismantle the lever (1a) from the mounting (1b),\nundoing the fixing bolts (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064673.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Working at the bench, fit the lever and\nmounting and tighten the fixing bolts.</p><p>Fit the complete lever in its seating and\nsecure it with the fixing nuts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Gear controls</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H37</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Robotized gearbox AUTO function switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H34</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752673\">2127A16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752674\">2127A20</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]